config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_QUATT
	bool "Domoticz plugin: Quatt heat pump"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	default n
	help
		read the status of a Quatt hybrid heat pump

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/Domoticz-Quatt-Plugin, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		The plugin imports the Domoticz module and the Python standard
		library only, so no additional Python package is required.

		Setup: Setup -> Hardware -> Quatt, enter the address of the heat pump controller.

		Upstream publishes no license file, so the plugin keeps the licensing
		status upstream gave it. The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
